title Mind's clone comes current, and its two seated commits ship
prompt Keaton: send -- after showing Mind's round-open pull refusing publickey, and my repair and rebase of that clone.
think The refusal was the unarmed-fresh-clone class for the second time in one evening: the field routes SSH through its repo-local .git/ssh_config_urbit and the jail deploy key, and grain-mind had no core.sshCommand at all, falling back to a global config GitHub refuses. The clone gained its own .git/ssh_config_urbit pointing at the field's authorized key, and core.sshCommand beside it -- local transport arming, tracked by nothing, exactly like the field's own.
think The pull then did its real work: three rebase conflicts between Mind's two unpushed commits and the day's upstream, each resolved keeping both intents whole. The launcher kept Mind's Homebrew git (plain git on that Mac is Apple's Xcode stub) and took upstream's letter-folded tools/f/fetch-toolchain.sh. The loop script kept Mind's custody assert -- refuse when an unfinished signing transaction exists, the commit's whole point -- under upstream's seated battery stanza, with Mind's battery-sleep observation beside it. The session-logs pin took upstream's shelf table, and Mind's one flat log was born onto date/20260827/ with its row, per the law.
obs Proven before the send: the launcher prints GREEN, chatgpt-mind.rish executes past both merged stanzas in print mode, and index_row_bound, index_fold, and loop_prompt_parse are GREEN in this clone. The second pull of the twice-pulled way found upstream unmoved since the rebase.
obs This log is written by the supervising hand in Mind's clone, and says so plainly in its role field -- the two commits it rides beside are Mind's own, rebased rather than rewritten, their authorship untouched.
obs Named for Mind's lane rather than changed: the launcher pins the version-numbered /opt/homebrew/Cellar/git/2.53.0_1/bin/git, which breaks on the next brew upgrade; /opt/homebrew/bin/git is the durable spelling of the same choice.
loom conflicts_resolved=3 commits_shipped=2 flat_logs_shelved=1 guards_green=index_row_bound,index_fold,loop_prompt_parse transport_armed=core.sshCommand
file /Users/bhagavan851c05a/grain-mind/.git/ssh_config_urbit the clone's own transport arming, untracked by design
file tools/l/launch-mind-cardinal-chapter.rish Mind's Homebrew git kept, upstream's folded path carried
file tools/l/chatgpt-mind.rish the custody assert under the seated battery stanza
file session-logs/date/20260827/20260827-105635_battery-is-telemetry.kyri Mind's flat log, born onto its day's shelf
recommend check-in (Keaton) -- Mind's clone rests current on main after this send; its loop can wake clean, and the Cellar-pinned git path is its lane's one-line tidy
